{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05013","headline":"凤箫曲 · 沈佺期","name":"凤箫曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八月凉风动高阁，千金丽人卷绡幕。\n已怜池上歇芳菲，不念君恩坐摇落。\n世上荣华如转蓬，朝随阡陌暮云中。\n飞燕侍寝昭阳殿，班姬饮恨长信宫。\n长信宫，昭阳殿，春来歌舞妾自知，秋至帘栊君不见。\n昔时嬴女厌世纷，学吹凤箫乘彩云。\n含情转睐向萧史，千载红颜持赠君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05013.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05013","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}